#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:5 4af566689d81404faa03eca7b2903a1c
msgid "Stabilize Mode"
msgstr "Stabilize 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:7 989a9f2aebf0450e873b62a58d92eebd
msgid ""
"Stabilize mode allows you to fly your vehicle manually, but self-levels the "
"roll and pitch axis."
msgstr "Stabilize 模式允许您手动飞行，同时自动保持横滚和俯仰轴水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:12 d75806d63ddf465c88fb85d35295a92a
msgid ""
"If you're learning to fly, try :ref:`Alt Hold <altholdmode>` or :ref:`Loiter"
" <loiter-mode>` instead of Stabilize. You'll have fewer crashes if you don't"
" need to concentrate on too many controls at once."
msgstr ""
"如果您正在学习飞行，建议使用 :ref:`Alt Hold <altholdmode>` 或 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` "
"模式，而不是 Stabilize 模式。不需要同时专注于太多控制操作，坠机的可能性会大大降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:20 d231d4544a9d49349d74a06b48f83124
msgid ""
"While stabilize mode does not necessarily require GPS, switching to RTL in "
"case of emergency does. Make sure you do have a reliable position estimate "
"prior to arming, most commonly provided by 3D GPS fix with sufficient HDOP."
msgstr ""
"虽然 Stabilize 模式不一定需要 GPS，但在紧急情况下切换到 RTL 时需要 GPS。请确保解锁前具有可靠的位置估计，通常由具有足够 HDOP"
" 的 3D GPS 定位提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:25 6b91db393b8449bdafa81aa4eaabeaf2
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:27 13499fb0a63f40ce824a10cb34f20e3b
msgid ""
"Pilot's roll and pitch input control the lean angle of the copter. When the "
"pilot releases the roll and pitch sticks the vehicle automatically levels "
"itself."
msgstr "飞手的横滚和俯仰输入控制飞机的倾斜角度。当飞手松开横滚和俯仰摇杆时，飞行器自动恢复水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:30 5355af57fbfa4f31962eb048c877c3a6
msgid ""
"Pilot will need to regularly input roll and pitch commands to keep the "
"vehicle in place as it is pushed around by the wind."
msgstr "由于飞行器会被风吹偏，飞手需要定期输入横滚和俯仰指令以保持飞行器位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:32 8c4637aa2e8c427b9376cb594f8b3af6
msgid ""
"Pilot's yaw input controls the rate of change of the heading.  When the "
"pilot releases the yaw stick the vehicle will maintain its current heading."
msgstr "飞手的偏航输入控制航向的变化速率。当飞手松开偏航摇杆时，飞行器将保持当前航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:35 611f5412300841ab9bfd397c96450f8c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Pilot's throttle input controls the average motor speed meaning that "
"constant adjustment of the throttle is required to maintain altitude.  If "
"the pilot puts the throttle completely down the motors will go to their "
"minimum rate (:ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>`) and if the vehicle is "
"flying it will lose attitude control and tumble. However, this behavior can "
"be changed by enabling :ref:`airmode`"
msgstr ""
"飞手的油门输入控制电机平均转速，因此需要持续调整油门以维持高度。如果飞手将油门完全推到最低，电机将降至其最低速率（MOT_SPIN_ARMED），如果飞行器正在飞行，它将失去姿态控制并翻滚。但是，可以通过启用"
" :ref:`airmode` 来改变此行为"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:41 8a419248e2df4ce49c56220e2bec0f9a
msgid ""
"The throttle sent to the motors is automatically adjusted based on the tilt "
"angle of the vehicle (i.e. increased as the vehicle tilts over more) to "
"reduce the compensation the pilot must do as the vehicle's attitude changes."
msgstr "发送给电机的油门根据飞行器倾斜角度自动调整（即飞行器倾斜越大，油门越高），以减少飞手在飞行器姿态改变时需要进行的补偿操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:48 e1b97e53f622432bac9ab121e0b39268
msgid ""
"Always switch into a manual mode such as stabilize if the autopilot fails to"
" control the vehicle. Maintaining control of your copter is your "
"responsibility."
msgstr "如果飞控无法控制飞行器，请始终切换到手动模式（如 Stabilize 模式）。保持对飞机的控制是您的责任。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:53 43d636ee2b1d416cbed283ad159f9423
msgid "AirMode"
msgstr "AirMode"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:55 af527fc6782d4c3ebb520b949776c98b
msgid ""
"Stabilize mode can be setup to provide full stabilization at idle throttle. "
"See :ref:`airmode`"
msgstr "Stabilize 模式可以设置为在怠速油门时提供完整稳定性。参见 :ref:`airmode`"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:60 9e370cef640141a1931a8e5e49c64df6
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:62 9861c404f4674d2a9b1a2f57aa6be8d0
msgid "See :ref:`common-tuning` for complete tuning topics."
msgstr "参见 :ref:`common-tuning` 了解完整调参主题。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:64 7080b7b8b0bb43e6bc91133f35106296
msgid ""
"Using :ref:`AutoTune <autotune>` may allow you to automatically determine "
"the best Stabilize and Rate PID values. It is highly suggested running "
"AutoTune on your vehicle rather than manually adjusting PIDs. However, see "
":ref:`ac_rollpitchtuning` for roll and pitch manual tuning."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`AutoTune <autotune>` 可以自动确定最佳的 Stabilize 和速率 PID 值。强烈建议在您的飞行器上运行 "
"AutoTune，而不是手动调整 PID。但是，手动调整横滚和俯仰请参见 :ref:`ac_rollpitchtuning`。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:68 f5bcf9879a1c4e78b184e384babbaf19
msgid "Other important parameters"
msgstr "其他重要参数"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:69 bf38e7ba6a904a4aa1bf7fd7a402b349
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_ANGLE_MAX<ATC_ANGLE_MAX>` controls the maximum lean angle which by"
" default is 30 (i.e. 30 degrees)"
msgstr ":ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` 控制最大倾斜角度，默认值为 4500（即 45 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:71 dfbe12201d1a4914a2316fcb500a6e83
msgid ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>` controls the maximum yaw rate requested by"
" a pilot's yaw input in Stabilize and other pilot-controlled modes except "
"Acro. Higher values request a faster yaw rate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>` 控制在 Stabilize 及除 Acro "
"外其他由驾驶员控制的模式中，驾驶员偏航输入所能请求的最大偏航角速率。值越大，请求的偏航角速率越快。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:74 34effdc3a83d4664a2602d029c1374b9
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_INPUT_TC<ATC_INPUT_TC>` can be used to control the responsiveness "
"to changes in pitch and roll angles requested by pilot's inputs."
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_INPUT_TC<ATC_INPUT_TC>` 可用于控制对驾驶员输入所请求的俯仰和横滚角度变化的响应速度。"

